{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8e3eda13-bb06-80fc-af85-dac09d704333",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T12:48:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:45:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Calling about property tax bill. Square footage on it is wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I can help you with that. May I have the property address, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "122 Old Beach Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmela DeLuca. D-e, capital L-u-c-a."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. DeLuca. Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, I have the account. What does the bill show for the square footage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Says eighteen hundred and some. House is smaller than that. Way smaller. I have the old paperwork from when we bought, says fourteen hundred."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the figure you're referring to. The square footage comes from the assessor's property record, so a change would have to be reviewed by the Assessor's Office. Finance can't alter it from this desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Who do I talk to there? Is there form, or I just call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can contact the Assessor's Office directly, and they may ask for documentation, such as your closing papers or a floor plan. I can transfer you if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, transfer in a minute. First, also need duplicate bill. Mailed. I can't find the one that came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. I can request a duplicate be mailed to the address on record. Is that the same as the property address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same, yeah. 122 Old Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. It should arrive within several business days. Please be aware that the duplicate will show the same square footage until the record is reviewed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Fine. I just need copy for my files, and to show the assessor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's sensible. Do you have a phone number in case there are any questions about the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have 401-555-0191. Anything further before I transfer you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Sorry, I'm at work, between appointments. Front desk at accounting office, so I have a few minutes only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll connect you now. Please hold, and if the line drops, call back and ask for the Assessor's Office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. DeLuca. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
